#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:938
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:941
msgid "JetEngine could not save the taxonomy."
msgstr "JetEngine не удалось сохранить таксономию."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:949
